    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d649">

                <pb facs="0681" n="631" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg631"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-01-08"><hi rendition="#italic">January 8,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Does proposed agreement call for more on part of President than refraining from
                    excluding Spanish products under act 1890 in consideration of favored-nation
                    treatment by Spain?</p>
            </div>
        </body>
